flowchart TD
    Branch["Branch configuration"] --> Inherit{"Increment is Inherit?"}
    Inherit -->|No| Effective["Effective configuration"]
    Inherit -->|Yes| PR{"Allowed pull-request target<br/>identified from merge context?"}
    PR -->|Yes| Target["Use target as source branch"]
    PR -->|No| Sources["Find allowed source branches"]
    Sources --> Found{"Source branches found?"}
    Found -->|Yes| Recursive["Recursively inherit configuration<br/>with cycle guard"]
    Target --> Recursive
    Recursive --> Results["Zero, one or multiple<br/>effective configurations"]
    Found -->|No| Global{"Global increment is Inherit?"}
    Global -->|Yes| Skip["Skip orphaned branch"]
    Global -->|No| Fallback["Use global fallback configuration"]
    Effective --> Results
    Fallback --> Results
